[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10990.389, "timestamp": "03:03:10", "text": "我不在那里玩。我有一个很小的视网膜动脉瘤。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10993.67, "timestamp": "03:03:13", "text": "哦，对，我忘了即使我不……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10995.99, "timestamp": "03:03:15", "text": "正在观看的各位，我会联系你们的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10999.389, "timestamp": "03:03:19", "text": "就像啊，这个骑师"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11004.309, "timestamp": "03:03:24", "text": "笨蛋，他为什么总是把握不好跳跃的时机？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11013.309, "timestamp": "03:03:33", "text": "那？是的。还有，请给我补充水分。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11017.71, "timestamp": "03:03:37", "text": "现在。各位，别忘了补充水分。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11021.83, "timestamp": "03:03:41", "text": "记住，千万别忘了补充水分。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11035.55, "timestamp": "03:03:55", "text": "水烟筒。慢慢来，慢慢地做。哦"}]